Datasets Requested (check all that apply):
☐  Patient Personas (n=150) - Anonymized synthetic personas with demographics and preferences
☐  Preference Rankings (~119K) - LLM-evaluated rankings across therapeutic criteria
☐  Therapeutic Q&A Pairs (2,979) - Questions with generated responses
☐  Model Responses - Test Set (600 × 10 models) - Generated responses from all trained models
☐  Evaluation Results - Head-to-head comparison results and win rates
☐  Trained Model Weights - MODPO and baseline model checkpoints
Model responses include: Base, GPT-4o, SFT Empathy, DPO Empathy, DPO Soup, Joint-Loss DPO, MODPO Empathy, MODPO Survey, MODPO Survey4, MODPO Maxim
